<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR DAY, YOUR PACE</view><view class="title">安排一段，
刚刚好的时光。</view><view class="grid"><view class="field"><view class="field-label">出行日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{profile.date}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{profile.date}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">首站开始</view><picker mode="time" value="{{profile.start}}" bindchange="time"><view class="picker">{{profile.start}}</view></picker></view></view><view class="grid"><view class="field"><view class="field-label">和谁一起</view><picker range="{{options.group}}" data-field="group" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{profile.group}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">可用时间</view><picker range="{{durationLabels}}" data-field="duration" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{profile.duration / 60}} 小时 ▾</view></picker></view></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">你更喜欢什么？</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{tags}}" wx:key="label" class="chip {{item.checked ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-tag="{{item.label}}" bindtap="toggle">{{item.label}}</view></view></view><view class="grid"><view class="field"><view class="field-label">探索片区</view><picker range="{{options.zone}}" data-field="zone" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{profile.zone}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">出行方式</view><picker range="{{options.transport}}" data-field="transport" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{profile.transport}} ▾</view></picker></view></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">每次转场预留（分钟）</view><picker range="{{options.transfer}}" data-field="transfer" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{profile.transfer}} 分钟 ▾</view></picker><view class="small">由你设置的缓冲，并非地图估算；往返首末站交通另留。</view></view><view class="row field"><text>少走路，给停留多一点时间</text><switch color="#244d40" checked="{{profile.slow}}" data-field="slow" bindchange="switchValue"/></view><view class="row field"><text>仅找雨天备选（手动条件）</text><switch color="#244d40" checked="{{profile.rain}}" data-field="rain" bindchange="switchValue"/></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">生成我的行程 →</button><view class="small">资料可溯源 · 时间由规则计算</view></view>
